{"unit_id":"tag:0GN4:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为子集（subset）。设 <MATH_0003> 为层（sheaves）<MATH_0004> 的集合（set），其元素形如\n<MATH_0005>\n其中 <MATH_0006>。于是可以问：这个集合（set）何时满足引理 <REF_0001> 的假设？一个回答是，以下条件足够：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 对某些 <MATH_0007>、<MATH_0008>，映射（map）<MATH_0009> 是满射的（surjective），\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0010> 的每个覆盖（covering）都可由形如 <MATH_0011> 的覆盖（covering）加细（refined），其中 <MATH_0012>，\n<STRUCT_0004> 给定 <MATH_0013>，存在 <MATH_0014>、<MATH_0015>、映射（maps）<MATH_0016> 及 <MATH_0017>，使 <MATH_0018> 是满射的（surjective），\n<STRUCT_0005> 给定态射（morphisms）<MATH_0019>，它们在 <MATH_0020> 中，且 <MATH_0021>，存在 <MATH_0022> 及映射（maps）<MATH_0023>，等化（equalizing）<MATH_0024>，使得\n<MATH_0025>\n是满射的（surjective）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n我们省略详细核实，只指出上述 (2) 保证 <MATH_0026> 的每个元素（element）拟紧（quasi-compact），从而每个 <MATH_0027> 也拟紧（quasi-compact），见《位点（Sites）》引理 <REF_0002>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refined","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"equalizing","target_term":"等化"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集","context":"选定对象子集"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","co