{"unit_id":"tag:0H7B:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为位点（sites）的态射（morphism），对应于连续的（continuous）函子（functor）<MATH_0002>。设 <MATH_0003> 为 <MATH_0004> 上阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）的系（system）。置 <MATH_0005>。设 <MATH_0006> 为整数（integer）。以 <MATH_0007> 表示由满足\n<MATH_0009>\n的 <MATH_0008> 所组成的集合（set）。若 <MATH_0010> 的每个对象（object）都有由 <MATH_0011> 的元素（elements）构成的覆盖（covering），则 <MATH_0012>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系"},{"source_term":"integer","target_term":"整数"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"态射两端位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"位点态射"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的","context":"位点函子连续性"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"位点态射对应函子"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"系数层"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系","context":"阿贝尔层系"},{"source_term":"integer","target_term":"整数","context":"上同调次数"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"满足消失条件的对象集合"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"位点对象"},{"source_term":"elements","target_term":"元素","context":"选定对象集合的元素"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"对象的覆盖"}],"notes":[]}
